      "Shading",
      "Shading is the process of calculating how light interacts with the surfaces of 3D objects to create colors, highlights, and shadows.",
      "3D cube with visible edges but no shading.",
      "Same 3D cube but without visible edges and shading.",
      "Same 3D cube with shading but no visible edges"
    ],
